{"product_id":"inside-parliament","title":"Inside parliament","description":"\u003cp\u003eDerek O Brien dominated Indian television as the country s most well-known quizmaster for over two decades, asking questions to millions across India. Now he plays a key role in the Rajya Sabha, raising difficult questions from the front row in the Upper House. One of the most candid, courageous voices of the Opposition, O Brien is articulate, incisive and provocative qualities that are apparent in his writing. In this book, comprising his best political essays, Derek O Brien reflects on the state of the nation, offering insights from a unique vantage point inside Parliament. Never afraid of controversy or contention, he covers topics ranging from the Constitution, the effects of a hasty GST rollout and demonetisation to the media, the lessons he s learnt as an MP and the 2019 elections. Thought-provoking and captivating at once, Inside Parliament is required reading for all interested in understanding today s India and all who care about its future.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: O\u0026amp;apos | Brien Derek \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9789352773817 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 240\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44968442265753,"sku":"14RG9789352773817","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/6c56bca282ccc4fb8fe072584754debf.jpg?v=1732002744","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/inside-parliament","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}